    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/8463c9c41329bba49e76848b1a7e4cf3.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>Welcome to Nerd Space. <br><br>Nerd Space is a death match survival game that picks one survivor from 4 or less<br>Win the game by competing each other's luck and skills on different concept maps. <br>When you're done with the round, either select a weapon or change that weapon's capability to prepare you to win the next round.<br>Various weapons and maps are waiting for you. <br><br><br>Competition, survival<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/73fe7059b6fa8ceb00f88bd5ef49ece1.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>Prepare for battle to win various randomly selected maps, <br>Avoid obstacles that hinder your survival or use obstacles to win over your opponent<br>Also, use the tools to favor survival in emergency situations or the right circumstances to defeat your opponents and become the last person to win<br><br><br>The ability to evolve<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/756299d48989ba6c869ff868d905e20a.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>After the round, change the weapon so that you can win the next round, or change the capability of the weapon you are equipped with. <br>There are many types of weapons, and there are also weapons that can turn things around. <br>If you're not changing your weapon, you can change your weapon's capabilities. You can change your weapon's capabilities by changing its firing speed, increasing its damage, and so on <br>Secure what you lacked in the last round and become the final winner of the round",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/8463c9c41329bba49e76848b1a7e4cf3.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>Welcome to Nerd Space. <br><br>Nerd Space is a death match survival game that picks one survivor from 4 or less<br>Win the game by competing each other's luck and skills on different concept maps. <br>When you're done with the round, either select a weapon or change that weapon's capability to prepare you to win the next round.<br>Various weapons and maps are waiting for you. <br><br><br>Competition, survival<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/73fe7059b6fa8ceb00f88bd5ef49ece1.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>Prepare for battle to win various randomly selected maps, <br>Avoid obstacles that hinder your survival or use obstacles to win over your opponent<br>Also, use the tools to favor survival in emergency situations or the right circumstances to defeat your opponents and become the last person to win<br><br><br>The ability to evolve<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202460/extras/756299d48989ba6c869ff868d905e20a.avif?t=1727336586\" width=400 height=250 /></span><br>After the round, change the weapon so that you can win the next round, or change the capability of the weapon you are equipped with. <br>There are many types of weapons, and there are also weapons that can turn things around. <br>If you're not changing your weapon, you can change your weapon's capabilities. You can change your weapon's capabilities by changing its firing speed, increasing its damage, and so on <br>Secure what you lacked in the last round and become the final winner of the round",
    "short_description": "Welcome to NerdSpace, an action-shooting game that can be enjoyed with up to four people! Each round will feature a fierce battle, with random rewards for each round. With this reward, you can upgrade your character even more powerfully, so you can fight the battle of overwhelming your enemies in...",
